SUMMARY:Glorelys
LOCATION:Brooklyn Improv (The Lab)\, Williamsburg
DESCRIPTION:Glorelys Mora is a Dominican-American stand-up comedian\, actre
 
ss\, and writer born and raised in New York City. She is also the co-founde
 
r and host of Morir Soñandoytelling\, she brings a distinctly New York per
 
spective to relationships\, family\, pop culture\, and everyday life. Glore
 
lys has appeared on Netflix Is a Joke and Funny AF with Kevin Hart and was 
 
a finalist in the HBO Latino Stand-Up Competition. She has performed at The
 
 Comedy Store\, Hollywood Improv\, Laugh Factory\, The Stand\, and New York
 
 Comedy Club\, and has opened for Leslie Jones\, Zainab Johnson\, and Erik 
 
Rivera. Her sold-out debut at the Edinburgh Festival Fringe earned a five-s
 
tar review and critical acclaim. Her film credits include B Is for Bachata 
 
and We're Not Married Yet\, now streaming on Tubi. She is also the co-found
 
er and host of Morir Soñando Comedy\, a live comedy show and podcast celeb
 
rating Dominican and New York culture. DO NOT PURCHASE TICKETS FROM ANYONE 
 
